## Environment Variables

### Required Variables

```env
# Application
NODE_ENV=staging
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=https://staging.example.com

# Database (from Secrets Manager)
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:pass@rds-endpoint:5432/expense_mgmt

# AWS
AWS_REGION=us-east-1
AWS_ACCOUNT_ID=123456789012

# S3
AWS_S3_BUCKET=expense-mgmt-staging-attachments

# SES
AWS_SES_FROM_EMAIL=noreply@staging.example.com

# JWT
JWT_SECRET=<from Secrets Manager>

# RDS Proxy (if used)
RDS_PROXY_ENDPOINT=proxy-endpoint:5432
```

### Secrets Management

- **AWS Secrets Manager**: Database credentials, JWT secret
- **Parameter Store**: Non-sensitive configuration
- **Never commit secrets to code or CDK**

